        <helpText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(40, 76, 6);&quot;&gt;Dear &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(234, 18, 227);&quot;&gt;{!$User.FirstName}{!$User.LastName},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(56, 98, 47);&quot;&gt;This flow screen is designed to display the company information which will allow you to see the information from here only instead of going to website. If you still insist you can click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://orientelectric.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(4, 105, 193); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(56, 98, 47);&quot;&gt; to go to the company website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(56, 98, 47);&quot;&gt;Thank you, Salesforce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</helpText>
