                <fields>
                    <name>Fans</name>
                    <fieldText>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;{!$Resource.fans}&quot; alt=&quot;fans&quot;&gt;Fans For Homes, Offices and Kids&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Room&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;When it comes to high-end electrical products for the masses, Orient Electrical stands right at the top. Since their inception 60 years ago, they have been leading this sector with their range of high- quality, premium lifestyle electrical products that not only meet but exceed the expectations of modern consumers. Orient fans have been in the market for decades and today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
