                <fields>
                    <name>lightning</name>
                    <fieldText>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;{!$Resource.lightning}&quot; alt=&quot;lightning&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Lighting Homes and Offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are you wondering how to illuminate your home with smart lighting solutions? To help you in your search for high quality lighting, ORIENT LIGHTING INDIA offers top LED lights to achieve extraordinaryeffects. While normal lights are most of the time enough for an entire room, ORIENT LED LIGHTS will give you a performance that will set your interiors apart altogether.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
                    <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
