                <fields>
                    <name>appliances</name>
                    <fieldText>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;{!$Resource.HomeAppliances}&quot; alt=&quot;HomeAppliances&quot;&gt;Appliances to ease your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Looking for home appliances online? Orient Electric presents a huge range of home appliances, tailored to suit your every need. From a whole new range of air coolers which include desert coolers, personal coolers, tower coolers to window coolers, the brand has appliances to meet both your budget and requirements. Let us look at some of their other electrical appliances on offer online.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
