                    <fieldText>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;{!$Resource.SwitchGear}&quot; alt=&quot;SwitchGear&quot;&gt;Switchgears Or Lighting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(244, 87, 33); font-family: &amp;quot;Sans Serif Collection&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Accessories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Switchgears are very important safety components for homes as well as commercial spaces. They not only save your electronic devices from breaking down because of fluctuations but also save you from unnecessary shocks. Miniature Circuit Breakers or MCB in short are a must have electronic component for your home and office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
